            <ArticleTitle>Hospital-affiliated headache clinics in the managed care era.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>503-5</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Many headache clinics are affiliated with hospitals. These facilities were often started before the era of managed care. The new incentives and disincentives of managed care will force these programs to change their structures. Only those which document value are likely to survive.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
